  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Biofuels in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to improve the sustainability of biofuel production from soy and sugarcane in the Brazilian Amazon, in order to reduce deforestation, water pollution, destruction of natural habitats and violations of human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
